    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p>Make an attack roll against a PC within Very Close range. On a success, the @Lookup[@name] uses its tentacles to immobilize the target, sliming them with toxic sludge. The target is <em>Restrained</em> until they break free or slip out with a successful Strength or Finesse Roll. Each time the @Lookup[@name] is spotlighted, all PCs <em>Restrained</em> in this way take <strong>3d8</strong> direct physical damage. The @Lookup[@name] releases all creatures <em>Restrained</em> by it when it's defeated or takes Severe damage.</p>",
